OL,3,GNEWSAMND patient in race to access
OL,4,Alife-extending drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a rare form of Motor Neurone
OL,7,FDisease (MND) says he could die within
OL,8,Fa year while waiting for access to a
OL,9,Ftreatment that could significantly
OL,10,Fprolong his life.
OL,12,FMarc Powell, from Whaley Bridge,
OL,13,FDerbyshire, has the SOD1 variant of the
OL,14,Fdisease, which affects fewer than 100
OL,15,Fpeople in the UK.
OL,17,FDrug manufacturer Biogen is supplying
OL,18,FTofersen free of charge to specialist
OL,19,Fcentres, including Salford Royal, while
OL,20,Fthe NHS decides whether to fund it.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
