OL,3,GNEWSAMND patient in race to access
OL,4,Alife-extending drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, hospitals must cover the costs
OL,7,Fof administering it, so numbers are
OL,8,Flimited. The Northern Care Alliance NHS
OL,9,FTrust said Tofersen was not currently
OL,10,Fcommissioned by NHS England and
OL,11,Frequired specialist expertise and
OL,12,Fsupport to deliver safely.
